From bd11a3a345f1c0a882fb14f992bde1de47e03361 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HeroBrine1st Erquilenne <pankov.76.tvink@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add q6_0 KV cache support

Adapted from beellama.cpp commit 2446c0ed4 for upstream b10066.
Resolves conflicts caused by upstream Q2_0 type addition, fattn kv-type
helper refactor, set_rows F16->F16 case, test-backend-ops Q2_0 integration,
and the mmq.cuh function-based dispatch refactor (load_tiles moved to
mmq-load-tiles.cuh, per-arch configs split into mmq-config-*.cuh).

Assisted-by: opencode
